{
  "uid": "plugin-runtime",
  "title": "Plugin runtime",
  "tags": ["bot-manager", "observability", "plugin"],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "weekStart": "",
  "timezone": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "refresh": "1m",
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this dashboard is for",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Classloader / metaspace leak detection for the plugin hot-reload work (PLUGIN_HOT_RELOAD Phase 1).\n\nUntil step 4 introduces a child `ClassLoader` there is **one** plugin version, `builtin`, so the healthy readings here are **flat metaspace**, **flat loaded classes**, and `plugin_classloaders_live = 1`. That is the point: the instruments predate the mechanism, and the default time range is 7 days because the deliverable is a *baseline* (`-XX:MaxMetaspaceSize` is sized from it at step 4 — AD-6).\n\nRead `live` as a **lower bound on retention** — a cleared weak reference proves the loader was collected, but `System.gc()` is a hint, so a loader that is unreachable and not yet collected still counts. `registered_total − reclaimed_total` staying above zero after a drain *is* the leak."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Metaspace used",
      "description": "The series MetaspaceGrowth alerts on. Should be flat — classes are loaded at boot and essentially never after. There is no -XX:MaxMetaspaceSize, so growth here ends in a kernel OOM-kill, not an OutOfMemoryError.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"nonheap\",id=\"Metaspace\"}",
          "legendFormat": "metaspace used"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"nonheap\",id=\"Compressed Class Space\"}",
          "legendFormat": "compressed class space"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Metaspace growth per 24h (MetaspaceGrowth's expression)",
      "description": "delta over 24h — series A is the raw value, series B is what the alert actually evaluates. The rule is gated on >24h of JVM uptime (plan Amendment A3), because metaspace ramps 0 → ~90-140 MB at boot and delta() extrapolates a partially-covered range, so an ungated rule fires for ~23h after every restart. That is why B is absent for the first day after a deploy and A is not: a large A with no B is the boot ramp, and is expected. Threshold 50 MiB is a first guess, to be tuned from the 7-day baseline read off a JVM with >24h uptime.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "bytes",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 52428800
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "delta(jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"nonheap\",id=\"Metaspace\"}[24h])",
          "legendFormat": "metaspace delta 24h (raw)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "delta(jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"nonheap\",id=\"Metaspace\"}[24h]) and on(job) (time() - process_start_time_seconds{job=\"bot-manager\"} > 86400)",
          "legendFormat": "as MetaspaceGrowth evaluates it (>24h uptime)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Classes loaded",
      "description": "jvm_classes_loaded_classes counts CLASSES, not loaders — it is the corroborating series, not the leak detector.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "jvm_classes_loaded_classes",
          "legendFormat": "loaded"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Class unloading rate (1h)",
      "description": "The JVM-side corroboration that a dropped classloader actually released its metaspace. Zero forever alongside a rising plugin_classloaders_live is the leak signature.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(jvm_classes_unloaded_classes_total[1h])",
          "legendFormat": "unloaded/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Plugin classloaders live",
      "description": "Registered loaders whose weak reference has not been cleared. Exactly 1 (builtin) until step 5; at most 2 concurrent versions from then on (AD-5).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "plugin_classloaders_live",
          "legendFormat": "{{pluginVersion}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Plugin classloaders registered vs reclaimed",
      "description": "registered_total − reclaimed_total staying above zero after a version is dropped IS the retention. Both are cumulative counters, drawn raw on purpose. The left-hand series is NOT named _created_total: `_created` is a reserved Prometheus suffix and such a counter scrapes as plugin_classloaders_total, so this panel queried an empty vector forever.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "plugin_classloaders_registered_total",
          "legendFormat": "registered {{pluginVersion}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "plugin_classloaders_reclaimed_total",
          "legendFormat": "reclaimed {{pluginVersion}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Bots by plugin version",
      "description": "The drain's progress bar from step 5 onwards. sum(bots_by_plugin_version) must equal bots_managed — a shortfall means a bot escaped the accounting.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (pluginVersion) (bots_by_plugin_version)",
          "legendFormat": "{{pluginVersion}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "bots_managed",
          "legendFormat": "bots_managed (cross-check)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
